{"id":"ch-53i","title":"Add WorkflowQuery.findByProgressData() for UPDATE event queries","description":"Add method to WorkflowQuery to find existing workflows by filtering on progressData fields. Needed for UPDATE event handlers to find existing PENDING workflows.

USE CASE:
SquareEventsReceivedForMerchant event needs to find existing PENDING workflow for a merchantId:
```typescript
const existing = yield* workflowQuery.findByProgressData({
  workflowType: "ProcessSquareEvents",
  status: "Pending",
  progressFilter: { merchantId: merchantId }
});
```

SIGNATURE:
```typescript
findByProgressData: <TProgress>(
  params: {
    workflowType: string,
    status?: WorkflowStatus,
    progressFilter: Record<string, unknown>
  },
  progressSchema: Schema.Schema<TProgress>
) => Effect<Option<WorkflowState<TProgress>>, QueryError>
```

IMPLEMENTATION:
Use Prisma's JSON path queries:
```typescript
prisma.workflowState.findFirst({
  where: {
    workflowType: params.workflowType,
