{"id":"ch-6m2","title":"Create SquareEventsReceivedForMerchant UPDATE event","description":"Create new domain event for appending Square events to existing workflow queue.

EVENT SCHEMA:
```typescript
export class SquareEventsReceivedForMerchant extends Schema.TaggedClass<SquareEventsReceivedForMerchant>()(
  "SquareEventsReceivedForMerchant",
  {
    merchantId: MerchantId,
    eventIds: Schema.Array(RawPosIntergrationEventId),
  }
) {}
```

WORKFLOW INTEGRATION:
Update ProcessSquareEventsWorkflow to handle this event:
```typescript
Workflow.make({
  createEvents: Schema.Union(ProcessSquareEventsRequested),
  updateEvents: Schema.Union(SquareEventsReceivedForMerchant),

  handleUpdateEvent: (event: SquareEventsReceivedForMerchant) =>
    Effect.gen(function* () {
      const { merchantId, eventIds } = event;
      const workflowQuery = yield* WorkflowStateQuery;

      // Find existing PENDING workflow
      const existing = yield* workflowQuery.findByProgressData({
        workflowType: "ProcessSquareEvents",
        status: "Pending",
        progressFilter: { merchantId }
      }, ProcessSquareEventsProgress);

      if (Option.isSome(existing)) {
        // Append to existing
        const progress = existing.value.progressData;
        return {
          workflowId: existing.value.id,
          progress: new ProcessSquareEventsProgress({
            ...progress,
            totalEvents: progress.totalEvents + eventIds.length,
            remainingEventIds: [...progress.remainingEventIds, ...eventIds]
          }),
          isNew: false
        };
      } else {
        // Create new workflow
        return {
          workflowId: newId("Workflow"),
          progress: new ProcessSquareEventsProgress({
            merchantId,
            phase: "Processing",
            totalEvents: eventIds.length,
            remainingEventIds: eventIds,
            // ... other fields
          }),
          isNew: true
        };
      }
    })
})
```

UPDATE SquareEventProcessor:
Replace direct mutation calls with event publishing:
```typescript
// OLD:
yield* workflowMutation.updateProgress(...);

// NEW:
yield* publish(new SquareEventsReceivedForMerchant({
  merchantId,
  eventIds: [eventId]
}));
```

